Hydrogen - A Beelink N100 running many self-hosted services :)

# Home Assistant
## reverse proxy
Tailscale Serve forwards requests to http://127.0.0.1:8123.
In Home Assistant, under Settings > System > Network > HTTP server, set:

- Trust X-Forwarded-For: enabled
- Trusted proxies: 127.0.0.1/32

Since Home Assistant 2026.8, HTTP settings are managed through the UI. YAML is a one-time import and then the UI nags about a repair, so its configuration is not automated.
